{"id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-display-fibration.md","title":"display map 余域纤维化","display":"df-display-fibration — display map 余域纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-display-fibration","aliases":["16-df-display-fibration","Display-map fibration"],"display":"df-display-fibration — display map 余域纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-display-map]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"§10.4, Definition 10.4.1 and following discussion, pp. 610–615 (PDF 630–635)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-display-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-display-fibration</span><span>Display-map fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-display-fibration — display map 余域纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.4, Definition 10.4.1 and following discussion, pp. 610–615 (PDF 630–635)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\">\\(D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 沿任意基箭头的拉回存在且仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>；例如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>。所有对象与箭头在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的足够大宇宙内编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^\\to\">\\(\\mathcal B^\\to\\)</span>、完整箭头标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\)</span> 与余域函子在下节构造；不要求整个基范畴有所有拉回。固定源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 与靶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 时该标签可简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b):d\\to e\">\\((a,b):d\\to e\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sd,td\">\\(sd,td\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中箭头的源靶。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。下节构造总范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span>、余域函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}_D\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}_D\\)</span> 及满包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_D\">\\(\\iota_D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&amp;\\coloneqq D,\\\\\nM_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in D\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_D(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0},\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_{D,0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\n\\iota_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota_{D,0},\\iota_{D,1}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&amp;\\coloneqq D,\\\\\nM_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in D\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_D(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0},\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_{D,0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\n\\iota_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota_{D,0},\\iota_{D,1}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\iota_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B^\\to)\n\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}_D)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\iota_D=\\operatorname{cod}_D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\iota_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B^\\to)\n\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}_D)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\iota_D=\\operatorname{cod}_D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>笛卡尔提升由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中的拉回给出。范畴、函子公理由逐分量复合立即验证，满包含保留全部交换方块。</li>\n<li>源与靶标签不可丢掉：相同裸对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 可能属于不同对象之间的交换方块。完整标签使全箭头集上的源靶函数单值；固定 Hom 内仍可采用习惯简写。</li>\n<li>来源：§10.4、Definition 10.4.1，pp.610–615（PDF630–635）；这里采用与本书目录余域范畴相同的明确标签编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B$ 沿任意基箭头的拉回存在且仍在 $D$；例如 [[16-df-display-map]] 的 $D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$。所有对象与箭头在 [[16-df-category]] 的足够大宇宙内编码。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B$ 沿任意基箭头的拉回存在且仍在 $D$；例如 [[16-df-display-map]] 的 $D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$。所有对象与箭头在 [[16-df-category]] 的足够大宇宙内编码。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-category]]。下节构造总范畴 $\\mathbf D$、余域函子 $\\operatorname{cod}_D$ 及满包含 $\\iota_D$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-category]]。下节构造总范畴 $\\mathbf D$、余域函子 $\\operatorname{cod}_D$ 及满包含 $\\iota_D$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-category]]。下节构造总范畴 $\\mathbf D$、余域函子 $\\operatorname{cod}_D$ 及满包含 $\\iota_D$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B^\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b):d\\to e","display":false},{"tex":"sd,td","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib},\\mathrm{Functor},\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a',b'\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a'a,b'b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&\\coloneqq D,\\\\\nM_D&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in D\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,se)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_D\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_D(d)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle e,r,a',b'\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a'a,b'b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf D&\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0}(d)&\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_D&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_{D,0},\\operatorname{cod}_{D,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_{D,0}(d)&\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\n\\iota_{D,1}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\iota_D&\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota_{D,0},\\iota_{D,1}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod}_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\iota_D,\\mathbf D,\\mathcal B^\\to)\n\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}_D)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\iota_D=\\operatorname{cod}_D.","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false}],"bytes":3628,"backlinks":[{"id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"箭头范畴的单位与复合逐分量定义；基范畴单位律、结合律给出其范畴公理，两个分量投影保持这些运算，故 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}$ 是函子。完整标签与 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]、[[16-df-display-fibration]] 的编码一致；此构造本身不需要拉回。"},{"id":"2ac3d596368e32ad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 是 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 中的拉回稳定态射类，$\\iota_D:\\mathbf D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 为满包含。"},{"id":"fa153f5cc8052173","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}$ 在下文定义。仅在 $\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)$ 成立时使用下文的总范畴别名；其中 $\\mathbf D$ 是 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 对同一 $\\mathcal D$ 构造的全交换方块范畴。"},{"id":"ed457575028b1d57","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map-category]]。$p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]]，固定提升选择；其纤维写作 $\\mathcal D/I$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-fibration|df-display-fibration — display map 余域纤维化]]"},{"id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf D$、满包含 $\\iota_D$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 的带源靶标签交换方块构造；$\\bar\\chi$ 由下节给出的对象/箭头映射定义。"}],"outgoing":["274c21b30aac62ac","c9801f31ec8ac53f","fc49efccd7348d66","25a281534aa42440"]}